 "message": "I couldn't change Mark Ellison's (E034) last day to 20 November 2026. His record already has status \"offboarding\" with a last day of 27 November 2026, and the system only accepts a new offboarding for active employees, so it rejected the update. I haven't filed anything else.\n\nTo move the date, the existing offboarding record has to be corrected by HR or IT. Please contact HR, or I can escalate it to HR now if you'd like. Access is currently scheduled to be removed at 17:00 on 27 November, so it will not be removed on 20 November until the record is changed.",
